<title>ITALY: Italy records bop surplus in September.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop surplus in September.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 2.898 trillion lire surplus in September, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     Sept 96	 Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p> Total			+2,898	 -3,191     -4,005</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  +24,207	+21,385     +1,264</p>
<p> Capital movements	+1,500	-13,499     +1,502</p>
<p>  -Year to date	   -5,019	 -8,811     -2,534</p>
</text>
